Cloudflare Workers, D1 y Durable Objects. wrangler para los tres. :: Cloudflare Workers, D1 and Durable Objects. wrangler for all three.
Calidad: :: Quality:
Vitest en tests unitarios, Playwright + axe-core en end-to-end y accesibilidad asegurando UI/UX, con E2E de agentes de IA apoyados de documentación y orquestación orgánica. :: Vitest in unit tests, Playwright + axe-core in end-to-end and accessibility ensuring UI/UX, with AI agent-driven E2E supported by documentation and organic orchestration.
